<item><title>Niger&apos;s Tiani summons advisory council after Chad protests expulsions</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/niger-s-tiani-summons-advisory-council-after-chad-protests-b3ea82/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/niger-s-tiani-summons-advisory-council-after-chad-protests-b3ea82/</guid><category>Chad</category><description>The council is due to meet on 1 December as Chad condemns the collective expulsion of Mahamid civilians and calls for case-by-case review.</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 05:24:03 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/td.jpg" length="30806" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/td.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Chad allocates CFA420 billion and 90 billion in external funds to roads</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/chad-allocates-cfa420-billion-and-90-billion-in-external-9da8b0/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/chad-allocates-cfa420-billion-and-90-billion-in-external-9da8b0/</guid><category>Chad</category><description>The 2027 budget sets total investment at 1 458,132 milliards de FCFA, up 24%, with roads taking more than 53% of domestic investment resources.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:52:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/chad-allocates-cfa420-billion-and-90-billion-in-external-9da8b0/share.jpg" length="44048" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/chad-allocates-cfa420-billion-and-90-billion-in-external-9da8b0/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
